WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:13.528 --> 00:00:16.230
I can’t give you much advice
because I’m not a photographer.

00:00:16.253 --> 00:00:17.830
When I heard that
you have a photoshoot with Sun today,

00:00:17.860 --> 00:00:18.988
I rushed to see you.

00:00:24.450 --> 00:00:27.539
(She cries and is scared.)

00:00:29.160 --> 00:00:32.330
[KEY HAS A NIGHTMARE. SO CHAN HOLDS HER.]

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:35.030
[YOU TAKE GOOD CARE OF HER.]

00:00:35.060 --> 00:00:41.151
You startle awake. Then you feel scared.

00:00:41.270 --> 00:00:42.299
(Slate.)

00:00:42.893 --> 00:00:43.800
(Is the sound okay?)

00:00:56.940 --> 00:00:59.210
[IS KEY’S CHEEK SOFT?]

00:01:00.862 --> 00:01:02.497
Simba will have breakfast here?

00:01:05.068 --> 00:01:06.731
Are you sure that was the dream?

00:01:07.087 --> 00:01:08.197
Yes.

00:01:16.574 --> 00:01:17.302
(Cut.)

00:01:17.890 --> 00:01:20.391
(Simba, well done.)

00:01:21.680 --> 00:01:23.001
(Okay, good.)

00:01:23.020 --> 00:01:24.590
[GOOD JOB, MY BABY.]

00:01:40.500 --> 00:01:42.910
[OH, SOMEONE COMES TO WATCH HER.]

00:01:45.940 --> 00:01:47.897
(It looks like they will have a fight.)

00:01:49.360 --> 00:01:50.510
[I’D BETTER LEAVE.]

00:01:50.598 --> 00:01:52.099
I told my secretary

00:01:52.585 --> 00:01:54.300
not to accept anything from you again.

00:01:55.914 --> 00:01:56.797
It’s okay.

00:01:57.776 --> 00:01:59.890
I can go and give it to you
myself next time.

00:02:02.890 --> 00:02:07.470
It looks like Chan is uncomfortable
with you touching her.

00:02:14.514 --> 00:02:16.208
So you can also be a good girl.

00:02:16.800 --> 00:02:18.402
You usually act like a stubborn girl.

00:02:18.712 --> 00:02:20.702
So you will want to pinch my soft cheeks.

00:02:21.290 --> 00:02:22.398
Of course.

00:02:24.859 --> 00:02:26.602
I won’t let anyone

00:02:27.749 --> 00:02:31.801
hurt you or make you sad.

00:02:38.583 --> 00:02:39.611
(Good.)

00:02:39.640 --> 00:02:43.770
[THEY TURN INTO A BIG SIS &amp; A CUTIE.]

00:02:43.829 --> 00:02:46.800
(Shake your hand off.)

00:02:46.820 --> 00:02:48.190
[DIDN’T YOU PULL YOUR HAND AWAY TOO HARD?]

00:02:52.140 --> 00:02:52.739
[SHE CAME TO DELIVER JAY’S WATER.]

00:02:52.739 --> 00:02:53.670
Why don’t you take it?
[SHE CAME TO DELIVER JAY’S WATER.]

00:02:54.085 --> 00:02:55.903
Can you put it where I will use it?

00:03:06.060 --> 00:03:09.899
(Key, stay there until
she holds the water in her mouth.)

00:03:12.840 --> 00:03:18.130
[WHAT IS GEN Z KEY TEACHING P’JAY?]

00:03:23.771 --> 00:03:25.825
Argh! Six, seven.

00:03:27.010 --> 00:03:28.604
You are just a sugar baby.

00:03:30.422 --> 00:03:31.706
You’re not her girlfriend.

00:03:31.737 --> 00:03:33.502
Gently squeeze it.

00:03:33.604 --> 00:03:34.590
I shouldn’t squeeze it hard.

00:03:36.727 --> 00:03:37.494
It’s true.

00:03:37.514 --> 00:03:38.491
It smells good.

00:03:38.520 --> 00:03:39.448
Really?

00:03:39.865 --> 00:03:41.310
Stop it. There’s a sound coming from it.

00:03:41.888 --> 00:03:42.734
I can hear it too.

00:03:42.750 --> 00:03:44.202
I can make the sound too.

00:03:48.524 --> 00:03:52.050
Be careful. You’ll rip it.

00:03:54.884 --> 00:03:56.494
Let’s get back together.

00:04:01.220 --> 00:04:02.168
[MADAM JAY FEELS COLD.]

00:04:02.168 --> 00:04:03.167
I’m cold.
[MADAM JAY FEELS COLD.]

00:04:03.167 --> 00:04:03.570
[MADAM JAY FEELS COLD.]

00:04:03.570 --> 00:04:05.870
(You came to see your girlfriend,
but why do you dress like this?)
[MADAM JAY FEELS COLD.]

00:04:06.650 --> 00:04:07.798
I still love you.

00:04:25.700 --> 00:04:28.099
(The shooting is over.
You don’t need to stay mad at each other.)

00:04:28.980 --> 00:04:30.410
[IF KEY TURNS TO BE MEAN,
CHAN CAN’T HANDLE HER.]

00:04:30.410 --> 00:04:31.896
She’s so into her character.
[IF KEY TURNS TO BE MEAN,
CHAN CAN’T HANDLE HER.]

00:04:31.896 --> 00:04:32.230
[IF KEY TURNS TO BE MEAN,
CHAN CAN’T HANDLE HER.]

00:04:34.840 --> 00:04:35.731
[BE NICE, GIRL. YOU’RE A CELEBRITY.]

00:04:35.731 --> 00:04:37.200
She’s on another level.
[BE NICE, GIRL. YOU’RE A CELEBRITY.]

00:04:37.200 --> 00:04:37.850
[BE NICE, GIRL. YOU’RE A CELEBRITY.]

00:04:38.574 --> 00:04:39.797
She wouldn’t stop.

00:04:40.600 --> 00:04:44.490
[SHE FLICKS HER HAIR AND GOES HER WAY.]

